.TH SANCHALA-DOCK-SETTINGS 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-dock-settings \- Dock/panel configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-dock-settings
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure the dock/taskbar position, size, behavior, and appearance.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show current settings
.TP
.B position \fItop|bottom|left|right\fR
Set dock position
.TP
.B size \fIsmall|medium|large\fR
Set icon size
.TP
.B autohide \fIon|off\fR
Enable/disable auto-hide
.TP
.B style \fIfloating|attached\fR
Set dock style
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-dock-settings position bottom
.TP
sanchala-dock-settings autohide on
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
